          "content": {
            "id": "9d57ff8c-ccfd-380c-8162-96e3a8c4ce1d",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Verint $2B deal, tariffs weigh on Wayfair, Opendoor climbs",
            "description": "<p>Here's what you need to know about three stories investors are watching from <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/alexandra-canal/\">Allie Canal</a> on <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute</a>.</p>\n<p>Verint Systems (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/VRNT\">VRNT</a>) is set to go private with Thoma Bravo acquiring the company in a $2 billion cash deal.</p>\n<p>Furniture stocks like Wayfair (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/W\">W</a>), RH (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/RH\">RH</a>), and Lovesac (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/LOVE\">LOVE</a>) are under pressure after President Trump warned of upcoming furniture tariffs.</p>\n<p>Opendoor (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/OPEN\">OPEN</a>) stock hit a fresh 52-week high on reignited rate-cut hopes.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
            "summary": "Here's what you need to know about three stories investors are watching from Allie Canal on Yahoo Finance's Market Minute. Verint Systems (VRNT) is set to go private with Thoma Bravo acquiring the company in a $2 billion cash deal. Furniture stocks like Wayfair (W), RH (RH), and Lovesac (LOVE) are under pressure after President Trump warned of upcoming furniture tariffs. Opendoor (OPEN) stock hit a fresh 52-week high on reignited rate-cut hopes. Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.",
